   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48D3

   1 a 0000 E48D3:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2d] STATIC on CHARACTER (FIXED) as an OPEN TITLE
   4 a 0006      operand -- E46F2 is the automatic fixed witness (the LXI H /
   5 a 0006      MVI A,08 / ?SLCTS sequence); does DR pass the DECLARED length
   6 a 0006      here too, and place the initialised cell in the static zone? */
   7 c 0006   dcl outf file,
   8 c 0006       nm char(8) static initial('AB'),
   9 c 0006       k fixed bin(15);
  10 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title(nm);
  11 c 0023   put file(outf) list('X');
  12 c 003D   close file(outf);
  13 c 0043   stop;
  14 a 0046 end E48D3;

CODE SIZE = 0046
DATA AREA = 000B
FREE SYMS = 38AC
END  COMPILATION
